<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 100 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 100 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.77    PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.62     SPREAD	+36 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
